Autopsy Digital Forensics Investigation
Overview

This repository contains a complete digital forensics investigation walkthrough performed using Autopsy 4.23.1. The project demonstrates the process of creating a forensic case, importing disk image evidence, configuring ingest modules, performing timeline and media analysis, and generating a forensic investigation report. The investigation was conducted on a Sony forensic disk image (.001 format).

Tool Used
Autopsy 4.23.1
The Sleuth Kit (TSK)
